note dnote Castaway's note | DAY 12 ON THE SPIRE'S ROCKS\n\nThe plane went over yesterday, low, full of small faces at the windows. Then it went over again, empty, and it did not come back.\nI have watched the man in the top window every night. He does not sleep. He talks to the radio as if somebody is there.\nLast night the lights on the Spire came on all at once, and out in the trench a teal light lifted its head and looked. Then they went off again, very fast, and the teal light lay down.\nI have fish, rain, and this pencil.
